</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As Son of Man it was,</l><l>Jesus, the Lord!</l><l>Thou gav’st Thy life for us,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l><l>Great was indeed Thy love,</l><l>All other loves above,</l><l>Love Thou didst dearly prove,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Righteous alone in Thee,</l><l>Jesus, the Lord!</l><l>Thou wilt a refuge be,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l><l>Whom, then, have we to fear,</l><l>What trouble, grief, or care,</l><l>Since Thou art ever near,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Soon Thou wilt come again,</l><l>Jesus, the Lord!</l><l>We shall be happy then,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l><l>When Thine own face we see,</l><l>Then shall we like Thee be,</l><l>Then evermore with Thee,</l><l>Jesus, our Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
